-## Nightly from arismoko/horizon
-
-This is the modding fork at [arismoko/horizon](https://github.com/arismoko/horizon), not an official upstream Horizon release. Use the [fork launcher for Linux x86_64, Windows x64 or macOS arm64 (Apple Silicon only)](https://github.com/arismoko/horizon/releases?q=launcher%40&expanded=true) to install these signed game builds. The official Horizon launcher does not install them.
-
